血沸腾的瞬间。<br />抑或，它也适合留下旅途中的点滴，如同截住一滴奔流不回的河水。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306305.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/99/Belonging-306305.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">翠绿披巾<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Emerald Shawl</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />15<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条流苏披巾，质地柔软而光洁。许多小狗似乎更喜欢将同类织物用作寝具，但受访者显然认为，让它保持现状就够了。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306306.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/72/Belonging-306306.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">太阳花墨镜<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Sunflower Sunglasses</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2.2<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>富于度假气氛的墨镜，一份来自热情小狗旅伴们的礼物。受访者对它表现出了明显的困惑：对于遮挡强光，它的能力还不够；对于滤去色彩，它能做的又太多。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B71.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 狗狗与海1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B71.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B71.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B71.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B71.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B71.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B71.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B72.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 狗狗与海2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B72.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B72.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B72.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B72.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B72.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B72.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "catego